か緊張しちゃって\n誰か押してくれないかなって\nギリギリまで待っちゃってたなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202402/mobL7vSLI.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誘惑に負けて\nたい焼きも食べちゃった\nおいしいおいしい\nこれは何味でしょう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8枚目シングル発売に伴って\nスペシャル応募抽選企画があります!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://sakurazaka46.com/s/s46/page/8th_single_serial?ima=0000\n↑ここからね、色々見れるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その中で、\n直接会えちゃってお話できちゃったりする\nイベント\n『リアルミート＆グリート』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月7日（日）幕張メッセ\n4月29日（月）京都パルスプラザ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『オンラインミート＆グリート』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月21日（日）\n今回は天さんとペアです!\nうれしすぎる⋯\nいつも明るく話しかけてくださります\n大好きな先輩です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも第1次応募期間は\n明日 2月25日（日）の23:59 まで です\nぜひにー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今から会えるの楽しみです\n待っていてもいいですか⋯？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うきうき わくわく にこにこ\n( ⸝⸝⸝¯ ¯⸝⸝⸝ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして\n個別オンラインミート＆グリート\n全完売したとお聞きしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近私を知ってくださった方もいらっしゃるのかな⋯\n少しでも気になって\nお話したいと思ってくださったこと、\nうれしいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会えるのたのしみです!\nもー!今からにこにこです!\nいっぱい仲良くなりたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの応援、\nとーーーても届いています\n何をしてても、\nいつも頭で考えてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよ明日から始まるね\nいつも長いようであっという間に終わっちゃうからさ\n大切にいっぱいお話しよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしみ( ˶˙ᵕ˙˶ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日19:00〜\nフジテレビ『新しいカギ 2時間SP』です\nどきどき⋯"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武元さんと一緒です!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202402/moblvIcuI.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202402/mobrPu0NJ.png","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛で隠れちゃってるけど\nカギサック って胸元に書いてあるんだ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは\nまたすぐ書きます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そういえば"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202402/mobbMYZoR.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202402/mobMERvDV.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたま通りかかって、撮れたー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr